WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.200
BudgetFlow — synthetic demonstration.

00:02.200 --> 00:03.900
Site manager view.

00:03.900 --> 00:11.600
The manager sees the weekly allocation window, project value and remaining budget.

00:11.600 --> 00:25.200
Unallocated labour costs are reviewed and assigned to the correct plot and work element.

00:25.200 --> 00:38.500
The full budget table remains available while the allocation is made.

00:38.500 --> 00:46.100
The updated allocation and remaining budget can be checked in the detailed views.

00:46.100 --> 00:47.800
Quantity surveyor view.

00:47.800 --> 01:04.000
A new variation records £500 client value, £400 budget and £100 margin.

01:04.000 --> 01:18.000
Controlled cost lines are added to build the client quote.

01:18.000 --> 01:24.500
The completed £500 quote is ready for export.

01:24.500 --> 01:34.400
An overspend request is reviewed against the appropriate project budget location.

01:34.400 --> 01:36.100
Accounts view.

01:36.100 --> 01:50.300
The accounts team selects the payment week, supplier routes and projects to include.

01:50.300 --> 02:02.500
The generated workbook provides payment schedules, detailed records and accounting tabs.

02:02.500 --> 02:06.900
The Sage-compatible export includes nominal and cost-code alignment.
